@startuml
title MDR-D02 Management Dashboard Authority Boundary
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Central PMS\npayment finality\nfiscal reference recording\nnormal ExitAuthorization" as Central
component "POS Server\nfiscal issuance\nfiscal numbering only" as PosServer
component "Payment Orchestrator\nprovider interaction\nverified evidence reporting only" as Payment
component "Vendor PMS\nraw session lifecycle\nnormal tariff authority" as Vendor
component "Gate Integration\nvalidate-consume-open-report\nthrough Central PMS authorization" as Gate
component "Operator Console\noperator workflow surface\nno payment/fiscal/exit/gate authority" as OperatorConsole
component "Management Dashboard\n& Reporting\nvisibility/reporting only" as Dashboard
component "Future Fiscal Exception Queue\nretry/readback/writeback/closure design owner" as FiscalQueue

Dashboard --> Central : read-only payment,\nfiscal, exit, session status
Dashboard --> OperatorConsole : read operator activity\nand evidence access summaries
Dashboard --> FiscalQueue : read exception backlog\nand navigate/handoff only
Dashboard --> Payment : no direct provider calls\n(use backend projections)
Dashboard --> PosServer : no direct fiscal commands\n(use Central PMS records)
Dashboard --> Vendor : no direct vendor calls\n(use projections)
Dashboard --> Gate : no direct gate calls\n(use Central PMS/gate events)

Dashboard -[#red,dashed]-> Central : cannot mutate payment finality,\nfiscal references, or ExitAuthorization
Dashboard -[#red,dashed]-> PosServer : cannot issue, retry, void,\nor mutate fiscal documents
Dashboard -[#red,dashed]-> Gate : cannot open gates
Dashboard -[#red,dashed]-> OperatorConsole : cannot approve discounts\nor supervisor overrides
Dashboard -[#red,dashed]-> FiscalQueue : cannot close exceptions\nor trigger recovery

note bottom
Dashboard can summarize and expose status, but cannot execute authority-changing actions.
end note
@enduml
